sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Consumer User
    participant Browser as Browser SPA / Gateway
    participant Edge as Supabase Edge Functions
    participant Storage as Private S3 Storage
    participant DB as PostgreSQL & pgvector
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI API (GPT-4o)

    User->>Browser: Opens camera on /analysis/capture
    Browser->>Browser: Evaluates live frames in RAM (Lighting, Blur, Centering)
    Note over Browser: All quality checks PASS (Green state)
    User->>Browser: Clicks "Capture"
    Browser->>Edge: POST /api/v1/capture/upload-url (Bearer JWT)
    Edge-->>Browser: Signed S3 Upload URL (TTL: 15m)
    Browser->>Storage: PUT single encrypted frame
    Browser->>Edge: POST /api/v1/analysis/orchestrate (storagePath, quizId, lifeId)
    Edge-->>Browser: 202 Accepted (analysisId, status: QUEUED)

    par Asynchronous Processing
        Edge->>Storage: GET frame via temporary signed URL
        Storage-->>Edge: Image buffer
        Edge->>Edge: Computes CIELAB a* redness, GLCM texture, melanin
        Edge->>DB: Reads questionnaire & lifestyle vectors
        DB-->>Edge: V_quiz and V_life
        Edge->>Edge: Fuses modalities & computes cosine agreement
        Edge->>DB: Queries pgvector for top-5 classical citations
        DB-->>Edge: Classical knowledge chunks
        Edge->>OpenAI: Synthesizes 5-part XAI completion (gpt-4o-2024-08-06)
        OpenAI-->>Edge: Structured JSON insight
        Edge->>Edge: Zod schema & safety filter validation
        Edge->>DB: Stores immutable snapshot in scan_results
        DB-->>Browser: Realtime CDC notification (COMPLETED)
    end

    Browser->>DB: GET /api/v1/analysis/:id
    DB-->>Browser: Full AnalysisResultContract JSON
    Browser->>User: Renders insight, doshic breakdown, routine, and disclaimer
